# Citation metadata for this repository. GitHub shows a "Cite this repository"
# button from this file (it must sit in the repository root), and Zenodo reads
# it when a release is archived. Before each release, update `version` and
# `date-released` to match the new tag.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Alloy Lab Database, Stage 5: a CALPHAD binary-ensemble screening threshold with an optional DFT + SISSO overlay (contract 1.0)"
abstract: >
    Code, frozen per-combination reports and technical note for the Stage 5
    screening of ternary compositions. An ensemble of open binary CALPHAD
    assessments gives the competing-binary formation-energy threshold with an
    assessment-scatter band (Nd-Fe-B, Al-Fe-Mn and Fe-La-Si reports are
    included); an optional Materials Project + Bartel SISSO overlay compares a
    candidate phase or nearest prototype with that band. The meaning of every
    number, the label set and the limitations are fixed in the contract
    (stage_five/CONTRACT.md). Earlier release of the project: Stage 4 Track A,
    an ensemble study of the Nd2Fe14B feasibility threshold.
authors:
